# my-plugins needs no environment variables to install or run; the skills set what they need per command
# (for example BLOG_IMAGES in aws-blog-skills). Optional overrides, see README "Configuration":

# aws-diagram-design assets folder for aws-blog-skills diagram_lib.py, when auto-detection fails
# AWS_DIAGRAM_ASSETS=/path/to/my-plugins/skills/aws-diagram-design/assets

# Global npm modules folder, so deck build scripts find pptxgenjs (the value of: npm root -g)
# NODE_PATH=

# Dev harness only (.claude/hooks/notify.sh): webhook URL that receives Claude Code notifications
# (optional, e.g. a Slack incoming webhook)
# CLAUDE_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK=
